{"type":"npc","name":"Agiyeft","folder":null,"system":{"attributes":{"hp":{"value":320,"temp":0,"max":320,"details":""},"ac":{"value":36,"details":""},"allSaves":{"value":""},"speed":{"value":35,"otherSpeeds":[],"details":""},"immunities":[{"type":"disease","exceptions":[]},{"type":"bleed","exceptions":[]},{"type":"poison","exceptions":[]}],"weaknesses":[{"type":"cold-iron","value":15,"exceptions":[]}],"resistances":[{"type":"acid","value":10,"exceptions":[],"doubleVs":[]},{"type":"void","value":10,"exceptions":[],"doubleVs":[]}]},"initiative":{"statistic":"perception"},"details":{"languages":{"value":["common","fey"],"details":""},"level":{"value":16},"blurb":"","publicNotes":"<p>It's said that the fine line between a healing medicine and a deadly poison is the dosage. Agiyeft dance upon that line with reckless abandon. Collectors of rare toxins, agiyeft travel the world extracting ailments from people and creatures to use in their strange experiments. A town may praise an agiyeft as a hero for purifying their poisoned water supply, but it's entirely possible the agiyeft was the one to poison it in the first place. Despite their sometimes unethical practices, an agiyeft is more pragmatic than malicious and will freely provide healing from poisons and diseases in exchange for unique samples.</p><h2>Contagion Collectors</h2><p>Agiyefts collect illnesses and ailments of all kinds, but they have a special interest in rare maladies or those with unusual symptoms. The most ancient among them claims to hold the only samples of several diseases thought to be long eradicated. While most agiyefts would be loath to release one of their deadly infections into a mortal population, the more cold-hearted of them could be convinced to do so in exchange for an enticing payment—perhaps simply a front-row seat from which to watch the disease spread.</p><h2>Suggested Monster Parts</h2><p><strong>Monster Parts</strong> 1,250/2,800/5,150 gp</p><p><strong>Eligible Refinements</strong> weapons (bludgeoning, piercing, slashing), armor (light), perception item, skill items (Crafting, Deception, Diplomacy, Medicine, Stealth)</p><p><strong>Eligible Imbued Properties</strong> bane, charisma, dexterity, energy resistant (acid, vitality, void), intelligence, life, lifeward armor, poison, poisonous armor, spells (Primal: @UUID[Compendium.sf2e.spells.Item.SUKaxVZW2TlM8lu0]{Cleanse Affliction}, @UUID[Compendium.sf2e.spells.Item.rfZpqmj0AIIdkVIs]{Heal}), throwing, wild</p>","privateNotes":"","publication":{"title":"Battlezoo Bestiary: Elemental Storm (Pathfinder)","authors":"Jared Skowron","license":"ORC","remaster":true}},"resources":{},"_migration":{"version":0.942,"previous":{"schema":0.941,"foundry":"13.347","system":"7.3.1"}},"abilities":{"str":{"mod":5},"dex":{"mod":9},"con":{"mod":6},"int":{"mod":9},"wis":{"mod":5},"cha":{"mod":7}},"perception":{"details":"blightsense 20 feet","mod":25,"senses":[{"type":"low-light-vision"}],"vision":true},"saves":{"fortitude":{"value":25,"saveDetail":""},"reflex":{"value":30,"saveDetail":""},"will":{"value":28,"saveDetail":""}},"skills":{"crafting":{"base":35},"deception":{"base":32},"diplomacy":{"base":28},"medicine":{"base":35},"stealth":{"base":28}},"traits":{"value":["fey"],"rarity":"common","size":{"value":"med"}}},"_id":"h2a3QXsiASd0zWaB","img":"modules/battlezoo-bestiary-es-pf2e/assets/portraits/agiyeft.webp","prototypeToken":{"name":"Agiyeft","displayName":0,"actorLink":false,"appendNumber":false,"prependAdjective":false,"width":1,"height":1,"texture":{"src":"modules/battlezoo-bestiary-es-pf2e/assets/tokens/agiyeft.webp","anchorX":0.5,"anchorY":0.5,"offsetX":0,"offsetY":0,"fit":"contain","scaleX":2,"scaleY":2,"rotation":0,"tint":"#ffffff","alphaThreshold":0.75},"lockRotation":false,"rotation":0,"alpha":1,"disposition":-1,"displayBars":0,"bar1":{"attribute":"attributes.hp"},"bar2":{"attribute":null},"light":{"negative":false,"priority":0,"alpha":0.5,"angle":360,"bright":0,"color":null,"coloration":1,"dim":0,"atte